flowchart TB
  Idle[Idle] --> Running[Running]
  Running --> Running
  Running -->|pause| Paused[Paused]
  Paused -->|resume| Running
  Running -->|ok| Done([Done])
  Running -->|error| Failed[Failed]
  Failed -->|retry| Running
  Failed -->|retry later| Running
  Failed --> Failed
  Idle --> Done
  Idle -->|skip| Done
  Paused --> Paused
  Done --> Idle
  Done --> Audit[(Audit log)]
  Audit --> Audit
  Failed --> Alert[Notify on-call]
  Alert -->|ack| Ack[Acknowledged]
  Alert -->|ack| Ack
  Ack --> Idle
